      "content": "i don't think i want to \"recover\" or build a foundation. it feels like trying to fix a house that's already been burned to the ground. everything is just gone. if the social part of my life is dead, then what am i even doing here? it's like i'm just a walking corpse waiting for my body to catch up with how i actually feel.",
